      "id": "P4-L11",
      "quote": "- Status is exactly lowercase `matched` or `unmatched`;"
    },
    {
      "id": "P4-L12",
      "quote": "unmatched amounts are `0`."
    },
    {
      "id": "P4-L2",
      "quote": "- Read parsed records through dictionary keys;"
    },
    {
      "id": "P4-L3",
      "quote": "records are ordinary dictionaries and retained source order is significant."
    },
    {
      "id": "P4-L13",
      "quote": "- Amounts are integer cents, and the function does not mutate inputs, print, or use global state."
    },
    {
      "id": "P3-L1",
      "quote": "Implement `load_records(text)` to produce the retained parsed records in source-line order."
