      "quote": "For an `ORDER`, `RECORD_ID` and `ORDER_ID` must be equal."
    },
    {
      "id": "P2-L6",
      "quote": "- `AMOUNT` is an ordinary decimal string with at most three fractional digits."
    },
    {
      "id": "P2-L7",
      "quote": "It may contain only digits and at most one decimal point, with an optional leading minus sign;"
    },
    {
      "id": "P2-L8",
